        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">According to ASTRA (2025), project specific data related to study "Anwendung der Ökobilanz-Methode für die Infrastruktur von Nationalstrassen".\n\n# Included processes\nThis process models 1 meter cantilever retaining wall with a height of 5.4 meters. Production phase (A1–A3) and construction phase/ transport (A4–A5) for 1 meter of installed cantiliever retaining wall, as well as trench excavation, foundation and backfilling are included. Disposal and deconstruction processes are excluded and modelled separately. Service life time 50 years</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
